# 8️⃣ Sliding Window Maximum

## 📖 Problem

Find the maximum element in every window of size `k`.

---

### Example

Input:

```text
[1,3,-1,-3,5,3,6,7]

k = 3
```

Output:

```text
[3,3,5,5,6,7]
```

---

## 💡 Approach

Use a **Decreasing Deque**.

The front of the deque always stores the index of the maximum element.

---

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(n)

Space: O(k)
```

