# 🔟 Stack vs Queue

| Feature | Stack | Queue |
|---------|-------|-------|
| Principle | LIFO | FIFO |
| Insertion | Top | Rear |
| Deletion | Top | Front |
| Main Operations | Push / Pop | Enqueue / Dequeue |
| Common Algorithm | DFS | BFS |
| STL | `stack` | `queue` |

