# 1️⃣1️⃣ Important STL Containers

## Stack

```cpp
stack<int> st;

st.push(10);
st.pop();
st.top();
st.empty();
st.size();
```

---

## Queue

```cpp
queue<int> q;

q.push(10);
q.pop();
q.front();
q.back();
q.empty();
q.size();
```

---

## Deque

```cpp
deque<int> dq;

dq.push_front(10);
dq.push_back(20);

dq.pop_front();
dq.pop_back();
```

---

## Priority Queue

```cpp
priority_queue<int> pq;

pq.push(10);
pq.push(20);

cout << pq.top();
```

